ork on different principles.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If a ship possesses Regenerating Shields, its current ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," increases by 10 (up to its maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},") when a ",{"tag":"a","children":["System Operator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/System_Operator","referenceId":"reference:75f56e8f22b64ca4"}," uses the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Recharge Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Recharge_Shields","referenceId":"reference:d4549c92a68a5d8a"}," Action. Normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Shields"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Shields","referenceId":"reference:70740894b304e903"}," increase their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," by only 5 when recharged.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
